{
  "name": "Summarize new YouTube videos into a weekly email digest with Apify and GPT",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "2787ff0c-3efc-46d0-8dfa-5b0e262a48a3",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -624,
        -176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 496,
        "height": 928,
        "content": "## One email a week for every channel you follow\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Every Monday the workflow reads your watchlist from a Google Sheet. Each row is a YouTube channel, playlist or single video URL.\n2. The [YouTube Transcript and Subtitles Scraper](https://apify.com/sauliusautomatesit/youtube-transcript-scraper) Actor on Apify expands the channels and playlists and pulls the transcript of every recent video. No cookies, no YouTube Data API quota, and only videos that really return a transcript are billed.\n3. The run is started asynchronously and polled, so a watchlist of forty channels is no problem.\n4. Videos summarised in an earlier run are removed by video id, so you only ever read something once.\n5. An LLM writes a two-sentence summary, the concrete takeaways, topic tags and a worth-watching verdict for each new video.\n6. Everything is appended to a Google Sheet archive and folded into a single HTML digest email. A quiet week sends nothing at all.\n\n### Setup\n\n- [ ] Create a free Apify account and copy your API token from Settings, API & Integrations.\n- [ ] Add an **HTTP Header Auth** credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`, and select it on the three Apify HTTP nodes.\n- [ ] Connect your Google Sheets, OpenAI and Gmail credentials.\n- [ ] Make a spreadsheet with a `Channels` tab (column `Source`) and a `Videos` tab, then paste its id and your email into **Settings**.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the schedule to daily. Send to Slack, Discord or Notion instead of Gmail. Filter on the `worthWatching` field so only strong videos reach the digest."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "abfbb1da-a9f1-4eff-89bc-19cd4596294c",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -48,
        -128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 832,
        "height": 288,
        "content": "## Weekly trigger and watchlist\n\nThe channels, playlists and videos you follow live in a Google Sheet, so you can edit the list without touching the workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4e46476b-d37f-4381-888a-36e9867d39a6",
